#uuid "092612b2-00fa-53f2-9670-ce20788500b5" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406947 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406931 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406947 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406934 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406947 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406935 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406947 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406936 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406947 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406944 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406947 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406947 1077 "selection" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406947 1079 #edb/ref 17592186406931 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406947 1080 #uuid "2819a566-5ed8-5910-94b3-ea46282d78d0" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406948 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406926 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406948 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406928 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406948 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406932 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406948 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406933 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406948 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406941 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406948 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406948 1077 "selection" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406948 1079 #edb/ref 17592186406933 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406948 1080 #uuid "97997922-270d-5956-b157-409ccbb997d8" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406949 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406920 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406949 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406921 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406949 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406927 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406949 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406942 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406949 1075 #edb/ref 17592186406943 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406949 1076 #edb/ref 17592186045493 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406949 1077 "selection" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406949 1079 #edb/ref 17592186406920 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406949 1080 #uuid "9af9df66-4779-52c1-bd4c-a452e7989789" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406950 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406947 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406950 1069 "q-158352" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406950 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406950 1071 "Compute $P(0<X<1)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{4}x(2-x),\\, & 0\\le x\\le 2, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406950 1072 #uuid "70b7a02c-90a1-5f9d-b1b7-a374071b4308" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406950 1074 "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a<X<b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(0<X<1) & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{3}{4}x(2-x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}{\\int }_{0}^{1}-{x}^{2}+2x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}{[-\\frac{1}{3}{x}^{3}+{x}^{2}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}([-\\frac{1}{3}(1)^{3}+(1)^{2}]-[-\\frac{1}{3}(0)^{3}+(0)^{2}]) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}([-\\frac{1}{3}+1]-0) \\\\  & =\\frac{3}{4}\\cdot \\frac{2}{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406951 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406949 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406951 1069 "q-158435" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406951 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045487 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406951 1071 "Compute $P(1<X<3)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{8}({x}^{3}+x),\\, & 0\\le x\\le 2, \\\\ \\frac{1}{8}(x-2) & 2<x\\le 4, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406951 1072 #uuid "70e45506-8937-5eb7-832e-8c6f85a45f1e" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406951 1074 "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a<X<b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(1<X<3) & ={\\int }_{1}^{3}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{2}\\frac{1}{8}({x}^{3}+x)\\,\\text{d}x+{\\int }_{2}^{3}\\frac{1}{8}(x-2)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}{[\\frac{1}{4}{x}^{4}+\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}]}_{1}^{2}+\\frac{1}{8}{[\\frac{1}{2}{x}^{2}-2x]}_{2}^{3} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}([\\frac{1}{4}(2)^{4}+\\frac{1}{2}(2)^{2}]-[\\frac{1}{4}(1)^{4}+\\frac{1}{2}(1)^{2}])+\\frac{1}{8}([\\frac{1}{2}(3)^{2}-2(3)]-[\\frac{1}{2}(2)^{2}-2(2)]) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}(6-\\frac{3}{4})+\\frac{1}{8}(\\frac{9}{2}-4) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}(\\frac{21}{4})+\\frac{1}{8}(\\frac{1}{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{21}{32}+\\frac{1}{16} \\\\  & =\\frac{23}{32}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406952 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406945 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406952 1069 "q-158464" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406952 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406952 1071 "Compute $P(X>7)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{36}x,\\, & 3\\le x\\le 9, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406952 1072 #uuid "71e34130-ba0f-56bf-99cf-bcd67e888e34" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406952 1074 "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a<X\\le b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is identical to zero for all $x>9,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X>7) & ={\\int }_{7}^{9}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{7}^{9}\\frac{1}{36}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{72}{x}^{2}]}_{7}^{9} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{72}({9}^{2}-{7}^{2}) \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{72}(81-49) \\\\  & =\\frac{32}{72} \\\\  & =\\frac{4}{9}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406953 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406948 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406953 1069 "q-87213" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406953 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406953 1071 "Compute $P(1<X\\le 5)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{1}{18}x,\\, & 0\\le x\\le 6, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406953 1072 #uuid "77d8a3b9-ab3f-5af1-ac16-cd6ceeb35611" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406953 1074 "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a<X\\le b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSo, in our case, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(1<X\\le 5) & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{1}^{5}\\frac{1}{18}x\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{36}{x}^{2}]}_{1}^{5} \\\\  & =\\frac{2}{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406954 1068 #edb/ref 17592186406946 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406954 1069 "q-158308" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406954 1070 #edb/ref 17592186045485 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406954 1071 "Compute $P(X<1)$ given that the random variable $X$ has the probability density function\n\n$$\nf(x)={\\begin{aligned}\\frac{3}{8}{x}^{2},\\, & 0\\le x\\le 2, \\\\ 0,\\, & \\text{otherwise.}\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406954 1072 #uuid "c5e575cf-c390-5240-8f9f-2e2ff4fb107f" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true] [17592186406954 1074 "If a continuous random variable $X$ has the probability density function $f(x),$ then \n\n$$\nP(a\\le X<b)={\\int }_{a}^{b}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x.\n$$\n\nSince $f(x)$ is identical to zero for all $x<0,$ we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}P(X<1) & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}f(x)\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{1}\\frac{3}{8}{x}^{2}\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & ={[\\frac{1}{8}{x}^{3}]}_{0}^{1} \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}[1-0] \\\\  & =\\frac{1}{8}.\\end{aligned}\n$$" 13194139533525 17592186045585 true]] :edb/tempids {"answer-0adb4037-3d21-5577-98db-0520851d8ec6" 17592186406920 "answer-0cdf27d3-c6d5-5df4-bb15-db45cd603f84" 17592186406921 "answer-1faf4f36-14d4-5079-9551-250ad4e3cf1f" 17592186406922 "answer-37263c1d-3a90-5cbf-a914-8e3374163496" 17592186406923 "answer-38f73634-8e2d-501c-be17-972c94091082" 17592186406924 "answer-39e8336e-8823-5190-8258-986854592e5f" 17592186406925 "answer-5b4c000b-c921-5509-a96b-cb9f0d93c9ec" 17592186406926 "answer-60218c40-e5fc-5799-88a4-377813f3a491" 17592186406927 "answer-670ba1f9-ed3f-5406-a924-34d394e42af4" 17592186406928 "answer-6ff15794-2a8c-5b30-8865-ea10f20a2b20" 17592186406929 "answer-7e67f1ca-b2f4-549e-815d-e10ef48f7256" 17592186406930 "answer-83221410-a10d-5d0e-83cf-13c429350eb6" 17592186406931 "answer-8f9616d5-ee83-53e1-8dc5-492827d8a46f" 17592186406932 "answer-90f92edc-d0c5-5a32-ba22-e172277f28a3" 17592186406933 "answer-9abc5f15-a3ff-5d2b-9f5e-c96ef4c927ad" 17592186406934 "answer-9dda9524-0d12-5c08-9e65-638d5e2ca147" 17592186406935 "answer-a4064c0a-6aa8-5917-b98d-ddc4782ccc34" 17592186406936 "answer-a4262a2b-8e1a-56af-8617-c7da79b0d0c0" 17592186406937 "answer-cc4990e6-36da-5175-b799-75a15592dbaf" 17592186406938 "answer-ceff823a-381d-55c5-8f08-28d5ad75ecd8" 17592186406939 "answer-e1005a2d-863c-5e8e-9016-26d842f75de8" 17592186406940 "answer-e5c1b6f1-8629-5f1d-8828-dbc4c3ad5ba8" 17592186406941 "answer-e92906ad-768d-5f7e-a293-b12fcc80bf8b" 17592186406942 "answer-ec9cd385-a95e-5534-93cc-032926c3dedc" 17592186406943 "answer-fbf93cb8-21ed-52ed-b5b8-e67b0f616bcc" 17592186406944 "answer-field-0429e26